 "interpretation_limit": "Library-level descriptive readout of frozen contrast tables on deposited TPM, with no animal field, so no animal-level or causal inference. Removing shared members makes the two gene sets disjoint; it does not make the programmes biologically independent, because ATF4 output and serine synthesis are coupled in the biology as well as in the lists. Transcript abundance of ISR target genes is a downstream proxy for a response set by eIF2-alpha phosphorylation and ATF4 translation, so no value here measures stress-response activity.",
